Module104501Name = DoliMCP Bridge
Module104501Desc = MCP Streamable HTTP for projects, tasks, time, employees, third parties, invoices and services

DoliMCPSetup = DoliMCP setup
DoliMCPSetupDesc = MCP Streamable HTTP is served at /custom/dolimcp/mcp.php. Each user has a dedicated MCP token (separate from the official REST API key).
DoliMCPPrerequisites = Required modules
DoliMCPApiKeys = MCP tokens (per user)
DoliMCPApiKeysDesc = Open Home → Users → select a user → tab "MCP token". Tokens are auto-generated secure alphanumeric strings. Users cannot type a custom value — only Generate, Regenerate, or Revoke. The official REST API key on the user card is not modified.
DoliMCPEndpoints = Endpoints
DoliMCPCursor = Cursor MCP (Streamable HTTP)
DoliMCPTransportDesc = Use header DOLIMCPKEY with the token from the user MCP tab (not DOLAPIKEY).

DoliMCPUserToken = MCP token
DoliMCPUserTokenDesc = This token is used only for AI agents connecting via DoliMCP. It is independent from the official Dolibarr REST API key. You cannot enter a custom value manually.
DoliMCPTokenStatus = Status
DoliMCPTokenValue = Token
DoliMCPTokenCopyNow = Copy this token now — it will not be shown again in full.
DoliMCPNoTokenYet = No MCP token — click Generate.
DoliMCPGenerateToken = Generate MCP token
DoliMCPRegenerateToken = Regenerate MCP token
DoliMCPRevokeToken = Revoke MCP token
DoliMCPRegenerateConfirm = The current MCP token will stop working immediately. Continue?
DoliMCPRevokeConfirm = Revoke the MCP token for this user?
DoliMCPTokenGenerated = MCP token generated successfully.
DoliMCPTokenRevoked = MCP token revoked.
DoliMCPTokenGenerateFailed = Failed to generate MCP token.
